      "content": "duct tape?? lol okay i guess if i have to. but won't that be super painful to pull off later? also, i'm kinda worried about the puncture being deep enough that i might need something stronger than just ointment. since i'm definitely not going to the clinic today, would it be okay if i just take some leftover antibiotics i have from a chest infection last year? i figure if i take a few of those now it'll just kill off anything the peroxide missed so i don't have to worry about it while i'm finishing this up. like, is that a safe way to just preemptively treat it at home?",
